          "id": "69c183a9414ac739409d3f99",
          "question": "<p>Find the square root of the given number.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>8464</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo></math></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
